                <pb facs="0386" n="298" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg298"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Herbert to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Private.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Newport</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1892-08-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 16, 1892</hi></date>. (Received
                        August 16.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am privately informed that order in council was passed Saturday abolishing
                    rebate at end of this season. Immediate change impossible, owing to contracts.
                    Hope to make official communication in a day or two.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
